WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.754
Microsoft documents log retention and routing,
but publishes no sample that computes

2
00:00:05.754 --> 00:00:11.062
lifecycle metrics or joins HR, the directory
and a card system into drift classes.

3
00:00:11.062 --> 00:00:14.572
So the nearest start is the
program's own drift pipeline

4
00:00:14.572 --> 00:00:18.387
from the Federal Modernization
Workbook's Book 19, Chapter 9.

5
00:00:18.387 --> 00:00:20.378
It compares validation kit runs,

6
00:00:20.378 --> 00:00:25.025
keeps names out of the tracker and writes
hashed, chained evidence packages.

7
00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.602
What it can't do is read lifecycle inputs,

8
00:00:27.602 --> 00:00:31.350
compute metrics against
thresholds, or assemble a period.

9
00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:35.235
The verdict: keep it as the scheduler,
the sign-in and the hashing,

10
00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.820
and give it a run shaped
for the lifecycle.
